%% Foldmark system context.
%% Everything below the user runs in one browser tab. The dotted edges are
%% capabilities that are specified but not implemented in this version.
flowchart LR
  User[User] -->|writes, prints, exports| Foldmark[Foldmark in the browser]
  Foldmark -->|documents, addresses, assets| Store[(IndexedDB)]
  Foldmark -->|preferences| Prefs[(localStorage)]
  Foldmark -->|rendered sheet, @page size| Printer[Browser print subsystem]
  Foldmark -->|.md, .json backup, .eml| Files[Downloads and file input]
  Foldmark -->|mailto:, .eml, clipboard| Mail[The user's mail client]
  Host[Static host / GitHub Pages] -->|application bundle| Foldmark
  Foldmark -. not implemented: requires consent .-> Drive[Cloud storage]
  Foldmark -. not implemented: requires consent .-> Contacts[Contact provider]
